    <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="http://data.nytimes.com/elements/nytd_per"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">: Roman Catholic Religion : Washington, D.C. Residence : C.E.O., Ridge Global, L.L.C., 2007-present; consultant, Deloitte and Touche, 2006- present; assistant district attorney, Erie County, Pa., 1975-1976; lawyer, Gifford, Lay, Johnson and Ridge (Erie, Pa.), 1972 -1982 Business/Professional experience : infantry staff sergeant, U.S. Army, 1968-1970 Military Service : Secretary of Homeland Security, 2003-2005; director, Office of Homeland Security, 2001-2003; Governor of Pennsylvania, 1995-2001; Representative from Pennsylvania, 1983-1985 Political Office : B.A., Harvard, 1967; J.D., Dickinson School of Law (Carlisle, Pa.), 1972 Education : daughter Lesley, born 1986; son Thomas, born 1987 Children : married, Michele Moore Stephenson, 1979 Spouse : Munhall, Pa. Place of Birth : Aug. 26, 1945 Born : Thomas Joseph Ridge Full Name</skos:definition>
