  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://data.nytimes.com/68275133144558478633">
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Khodorkovsky, Mikhail B</skos:prefLabel>
    <nyt:first_use rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2004-09-10</nyt:first_use>
    <nyt:search_api_query rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">http://api.nytimes.com/svc/search/v1/article?query=+nytd_per_facet%3A%5BKhodorkovsky%2C+Mikhail+B%5D&amp;rank=newest&amp;fields=abstract,author,body,byline,classifiers_facet,column_facet,date,day_of_week_facet,des_facet,desk_facet,fee,geo_facet,lead_paragraph,material_type_facet,multimedia,nytd_byline,nytd_des_facet,nytd_geo_facet,nytd_lead_paragraph,nytd_org_facet,nytd_per_facet,nytd_section_facet,nytd_title,nytd_works_mentioned_facet,org_facet,page_facet,per_facet,publication_day,publication_month,publication_year,section_page_facet,small_image_height,small_image_url,small_image_width,source_facet,title,url,word_count,works_mentioned_facet</nyt:search_api_query>
    <nyt:latest_use rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2009-11-22</nyt:latest_use>
    <nyt:topicPage rdf:resource="http://topics.nytimes.com/top/reference/timestopics/people/k/mikhail_b_khodorkovsky/index.html"/>
    <nyt:number_of_variants rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</nyt:number_of_variants>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Updated: March 3, 2009
Before Mikhail B. Khodorkovsky's arrest at gunpoint late in 2003, the company he founded, Yukos, was Russia's top oil producer and Mr. Khodorkovsky's wealth was vast and his influence extensive.
He had close relations with senior Russian officials, founded a charitable organization called Open Russia, underwrote civil-society organizations and spoke of opening Russia to the West and to Western business practices. Fortune magazine declared him Russia's richest man and said he had $15 billion in personal wealth.</skos:definition>
    <owl:sameAs rdf:resource="http://data.nytimes.com/khodorkovsky_mikhail_b_per"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"/>
