  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://data.nytimes.com/84808383139522824983">
    <owl:sameAs rdf:resource="http://rdf.freebase.com/ns/user.jamie.nytdataid.84808383139522824983"/>
    <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="http://data.nytimes.com/elements/nytd_per"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">At the time of his appointment in July 2007, Mr. Gilbert was also younger -- a mere 40 -- and far less well known than most of the Philharmonic's music directors, having served previously as music director of the Santa Fe Opera. But he had led the orchestra to strong performances as a guest conductor, and brings with him an infectious enthusiasm for new music.</skos:definition>
