  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://data.nytimes.com/50715111106733555533">
    <owl:sameAs rdf:resource="http://rdf.freebase.com/ns/en.warren_jeffs"/>
    <nyt:latest_use rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2009-11-06</nyt:latest_use>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Warren S. Jeffs was the leader of a polygamist community of about 10,000 members in communities along the Utah and Arizona border. Known as the Fundamentalist Church of Jesus Christ of Latter-day Saints, the group split with the mainstream Mormon church about a century ago over the issue of multiple marriage. The group?s followers believe they are the true followers of the teachings of the church?s founder Joseph Smith, while the majority Mormons accepted a political compromise to achieve statehood for Utah.
Mr. Jeffs was charged in November, 2006 with two felony counts of rape as an accomplice in connection with the performing a religious marriage and directing the couple to have sexual intercourse despite the resistance of the girl who was then 14 years old. The girl has said she was given less than a week?s notice that she had been selected for marriage by church leaders and that her husband was to be a first cousin who was then 19. She said Mr. Jeffs said that the marriage ?was a revelation from God? and ordered her to prepare for the wedding. Mr. Jeffs?s lawyer said the prosecution has amounted to ?religious persecution? against Mr. Jeffs and his congregation, and that officiating at a religious ceremony did not make Mr. Jeffs an accomplice to rape.</skos:definition>
    <owl:sameAs rdf:resource="http://data.nytimes.com/jeffs_warren_s_per"/>
    <nyt:associated_article_count rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">16</nyt:associated_article_count>
    <nyt:first_use rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2007-09-19</nyt:first_use>
    <nyt:search_api_query rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">http://api.nytimes.com/svc/search/v1/article?query=+nytd_per_facet%3A%5BJeffs%2C+Warren+S%5D&amp;rank=newest&amp;fields=abstract,author,body,byline,classifiers_facet,column_facet,date,day_of_week_facet,des_facet,desk_facet,fee,geo_facet,lead_paragraph,material_type_facet,multimedia,nytd_byline,nytd_des_facet,nytd_geo_facet,nytd_lead_paragraph,nytd_org_facet,nytd_per_facet,nytd_section_facet,nytd_title,nytd_works_mentioned_facet,org_facet,page_facet,per_facet,publication_day,publication_month,publication_year,section_page_facet,small_image_height,small_image_url,small_image_width,source_facet,title,url,word_count,works_mentioned_facet</nyt:search_api_query>
