  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://data.nytimes.com/51325761622997809723">
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Jan. 15, 1929 to April 4, 1968
“Like anybody, I would like to live a long life. Longevity has its place. But I'm not concerned about that now. I just want to do God's will. And He's allowed me to go up to the mountain. And I've looked over. And I've seen the Promised Land. I may not get there with you. But I want you to know tonight, that we, as a people, will get to the promised land!”</skos:definition>
    <nyt:first_use rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2004-09-19</nyt:first_use>
