    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Gen. Augusto Pinochet Ugarte, the brutal dictator who repressed and reshaped Chile for nearly two decades, died on Sunday at the Military Hospital of Santiago.
News about Augusto Pinochet, including commentary and archival articles published in The New York Times appear below.
Career  |  Obituary</skos:definition>
