  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://data.nytimes.com/81429835758166970073">
    <nyt:search_api_query rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">http://api.nytimes.com/svc/search/v1/article?query=+nytd_per_facet%3A%5BEdwards%2C+Elizabeth%5D&amp;rank=newest&amp;fields=abstract,author,body,byline,classifiers_facet,column_facet,date,day_of_week_facet,des_facet,desk_facet,fee,geo_facet,lead_paragraph,material_type_facet,multimedia,nytd_byline,nytd_des_facet,nytd_geo_facet,nytd_lead_paragraph,nytd_org_facet,nytd_per_facet,nytd_section_facet,nytd_title,nytd_works_mentioned_facet,org_facet,page_facet,per_facet,publication_day,publication_month,publication_year,section_page_facet,small_image_height,small_image_url,small_image_width,source_facet,title,url,word_count,works_mentioned_facet</nyt:search_api_query>
    <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="http://data.nytimes.com/elements/nytd_per"/>
    <owl:sameAs rdf:resource="http://data.nytimes.com/edwards_elizabeth_per"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Updated: May 6, 2009
, in 2004, as he ran for president and vice president, and then as the author of a best-selling book, "Saving Graces," about the breast cancer that was diagnosed in her the day after her husband's defeat. John Elizabeth Edwards became known to the country first when she campaigned with her husband,
In the campaign for the 2008 nomination, she took a more prominent role, both as an adviser to Mr. Edwards and as a speaker and attraction in her own right. On March 22, 2007, she and her husband announced that her cancer had returned and was incurable, but Ms. Edwards pronounced herself optimistic that it could be managed effectively with treatment. The couple said they would make no changes in their plans. "I expect to do next week all the things I did this week," she said.</skos:definition>
    <nyt:latest_use rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2009-07-12</nyt:latest_use>
    <nyt:topicPage rdf:resource="http://topics.nytimes.com/top/reference/timestopics/people/e/elizabeth_edwards/index.html"/>
    <owl:sameAs rdf:resource="http://rdf.freebase.com/ns/en.elizabeth_edwards"/>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Edwards, Elizabeth</skos:prefLabel>
