    <owl:sameAs rdf:resource="http://rdf.freebase.com/ns/en.steve_mcnair"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Updated July 8, 2009
Steve McNair was an N.F.L. quarterback for 13 seasons, 11 with the Tennessee Titans and 2 with the Baltimore Ravens. He was found shot to death in his Nashville condo on July 4, 2009. A 20-year-old woman, Sahel Kazemi, who the police said McNair had been dating for several months, was also found dead with a gunshot wound to the head. The Nashville police said that McNair was shot by Kazemi, who used the same gun to kill herself.</skos:definition>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">McNair, Steve</skos:prefLabel>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"/>
  </rdf:Description>
