    <nyt:latest_use rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2009-06-05</nyt:latest_use>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">www.tommy2008.com   Campaign Web Site:  Madison, Wis. Home:  Roman Catholic Religion:  daughter Kelli, b. 1969; daughter Tommi, b. 1970; son Jason, b. 1974 Children:  married Sue Ann Mashak, 1968 (President, Wisconsin Women's Health Foundation Inc.) Spouse:  B.S., University of Wisconsin-Madison, 1963; J.D., University of Wisconsin-Madison, 1966. Education:    Elroy, Wis. Place of Birth:  November 19, 1941 Date of Birth:  Wisconsin Army Reserve; Wisconsin National Guard Military:  Partner,Akin Gump Strauss Hauer &amp; Feld; independent chairman, Deloitte Center for Health Solutions; president, Logistics Health. Business/Professional Experience:  Wisconsin State Assembly, elected 1966; Governor of Wisconsin, elected 1986; re-elected 1990, 1994, 1998 (the first governor in the state's history to be elected to a third and fourth four-year term); appointed Secretary of Health and Human Services, served 2001-2005 Political Office:  Republican Party:  Tommy George Thompson Full Name:</skos:definition>
    <nyt:number_of_variants rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</nyt:number_of_variants>
