    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Richmond Home:    Roman Catholic Religion:    daughter Nat 1990, son Woody 1992, daughter Annella 1995 Children:    married Ann Holton, 1984 Spouse:    B.A., University of Missouri, 1979; J.D., Harvard, 1983 Education:    St. Paul Place of Birth:    Feb. 26, 1958 Date of Birth:    lawyer, private practice, 1983-2000; professor, University of Richmond Law School, 1988-1993 Business/Professional Experience:    Governor of Virginia, elected 2005; lieutenant governor of Virginia, 2001-2005; Mayor of Richmond, Va., 1998-2001; city councilor, Richmond, 1994-1998 Political Office:    Democrat Party:    Timothy Michael Kaine Full Name:</skos:definition>
