    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Dennis4president.com :  Web site    Cleveland, Ohio Home:    Roman Catholic Religion:    (with Sandra Lee McCarthy; m. 1977; div. 1986) daughter Jacqueline "Jackie" Kucinich (b. 1981) Children:    (3d) Elizabeth Harper, m. 2005 Spouse:    B.A. (1973), M.A. (1974), Case Western Reserve University Education:    Cleveland, Ohio Place of Birth:    October 8, 1946 Date of Birth:    Business Consultant, K Communications (renamed Kucinich Communications) 1986-1994; News Analyst/Reporter, WJW Channel 8 (Cleveland) 1990-1993; Marketing Director, software developer CRC International Business Solutions 1991-1992 Business/Professional Experience:    U.S. Representative from Ohio 1997-present; Ohio State Senator, 1995-1997; Cleveland City Council Member, 1983-1986 and 1970-1976; Mayor, city of Cleveland, 1977-1979; Clerk of Courts, Cleveland Municipal Courts, 1976-1977 Political Office:    Democratic Party:  Dennis John Kucinich Full Name:</skos:definition>
