  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://data.nytimes.com/18480379646696289353">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"/>
    <nyt:search_api_query rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">http://api.nytimes.com/svc/search/v1/article?query=+nytd_per_facet%3A%5BPrice%2C+Leontyne%5D&amp;rank=newest&amp;fields=abstract,author,body,byline,classifiers_facet,column_facet,date,day_of_week_facet,des_facet,desk_facet,fee,geo_facet,lead_paragraph,material_type_facet,multimedia,nytd_byline,nytd_des_facet,nytd_geo_facet,nytd_lead_paragraph,nytd_org_facet,nytd_per_facet,nytd_section_facet,nytd_title,nytd_works_mentioned_facet,org_facet,page_facet,per_facet,publication_day,publication_month,publication_year,section_page_facet,small_image_height,small_image_url,small_image_width,source_facet,title,url,word_count,works_mentioned_facet</nyt:search_api_query>
    <nyt:latest_use rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2008-04-30</nyt:latest_use>
    <owl:sameAs rdf:resource="http://data.nytimes.com/price_leontyne_per"/>
    <nyt:first_use rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2008-04-30</nyt:first_use>
    <owl:sameAs rdf:resource="http://rdf.freebase.com/ns/en.leontyne_price"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Take away the racial breakthroughs that made the soprano Leontyne Price's career so important and she would still be remembered on purely musical grounds.
Ms. Price made her sensational Metropolitan Opera debut on Jan. 27, 1961, as Leonora in Verdi’s "Trovatore," the first African-American to open a season at the Metropolitan Opera. But prior to that, during the late 1950s, operagoers in Vienna and Salzburg had already heard her powerful Mozart performances as Donna Elvira in "Don Giovanni."
As a black American challenging racial barriers, Ms. Price assumed work that had been largely begun in the 1940's by the American contralto Marian Anderson, whom Ms. Price has called "my idol, the symbol and the focus of my purpose as a human being."</skos:definition>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Price, Leontyne</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="http://data.nytimes.com/elements/nytd_per"/>
