    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">www.joinrudy2008.com/   Campaign Web Site:  New York, NY Home:  Roman Catholic Religion:  (with Donna Hanover; m. 1984; div. 2002) son Andrew, born 1986; daughter Caroline, b. 1989 Children:  Married (3d), Judith Nathan, 2003 Spouse:  B.A., Manhattan College, 1965; J.D., New York University School of Law, 1968 Education:  Brooklyn, NY Place of Birth:  May 28, 1944 Date of Birth:  Chairman and Chief Executive Officer, consulting firm Giuliani Partners, 2002-pres.; Partner, the law firm of Bracewell &amp; Giuliani, 2005-pres.; U.S. Attorney for the Southern District of NY, 1983-1989 Business/Professional Experience:  Mayor of New York City, 1994-2001 Political Office:  Republican Party:  Rudolph William Giuliani Full Name:</skos:definition>
