    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">News about Alan Ayckbourn, including commentary and archival articles published in The New York Times.  Left, Eve Bianco and Mark Alhadeff in the 2008 production of Mr. Ayckbourn's play "Bedroom Farce."</skos:definition>
