    <owl:sameAs rdf:resource="http://data.nytimes.com/welser_most_franz_per"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The Austrian conductor Franz Welser-MÃ¶st became music director of the Cleveland Orchestra in 2002. In June 2008, his contract was extended to 2018.
He has agreed to become general music director of the Vienna State Opera for five years, starting in 2010. In July 2008, he gave up his post as general music director of the Zurich Opera.</skos:definition>
