    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">fred08.com :  Web site : McLean, Va. Home : Church of Christ Religion : (with Sarah Lindsey; m. 1959; div. 1985) son Fred Dalton Jr., born 1960; daughter Elizabeth, b. 1963 (died 2002); son Daniel, b. 1965; (with Jeri Kehn) daughter Hayden, b. 2003; son Samuel, b. 2006. Children : Married (2nd) to Jeri Kehn, 2002. Spouse : B.S., Memphis State University (now University of Memphis), 1964; J.D., Vanderbilt University Law School, 1967. Education : Sheffield, Ala. Place of Birth : August 19, 1942 Date of Birth : Minority counsel, Senate Select Committee on Presidential Campaign Activities ("Watergate Committee"), 1973-74; Attorney/lobbyist, private practice, 1974-1994; Attorney at the Washington firm of Arent, Fox, Kintner, Plotkin &amp; Kahn, 1991-1994; Actor, 1985-present; Commentator, ABC Radio Network, 2006-present. Business/Professional Experience : U.S. Senator from Tennessee, 1994-2003 Political Office : Republican Party : Fred Dalton Thompson Full Name</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
